    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "영작문제 2 답안"
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "다음 문제를 영작해주세요."
    },
    {
      "type": "sentences",
      "items": [
        {
          "n": "38",
          "text": "The vision includes an Israeli and Palestinian state."
        },
        {
          "n": "39",
          "text": "They live in peaceful coexistence."
        },
        {
          "n": "40",
          "text": "He also spoke about the war on terror."
        },
        {
          "n": "41",
          "text": "The terrorist network tries to regroup and strike again."
        },
        {
          "n": "42",
          "text": "The US relied too heavily on Afghan troops."
        },
        {
          "n": "43",
          "text": "Are soldiers loyal to bin Laden?"
        },
        {
          "n": "44",
          "text": "That information came from war prisoners."
        },
        {
          "n": "45",
          "text": "Those claims are unreliable."
        },
        {
          "n": "46",
          "text": "Do they change their stories frequently?"
        },
        {
          "n": "47",
          "text": "It is entirely possible."
        },
        {
          "n": "48",
          "text": "He could still be there."
        },
        {
          "n": "49",
          "text": "May I help you?"
        },
        {
          "n": "50",
          "text": "What can I do for you?"
        },
        {
          "n": "51",
          "text": "Could you just have a seat for a moment?"
        },
        {
          "n": "52",
          "text": "Which one did you take?"
        },
        {
          "n": "53",
          "text": "I went down there."
        },
        {
          "n": "54",
          "text": "I talked to my boss."
        }
      ]
    },
